URL: https://restoapp.com/admin/stock-manager#out-of-stock
Path: Sidebar -> Stock Manager -> Click "Нет в наличии" tab.
Description: Shows all items that are currently out of stock. If all products are available, a celebratory message is shown.

Annotation:
- Red oval around the "Нет в наличии" tab
- Red hollow arrow pointing to the tab
- Red text "Стоп-лист из iiko"
